SUMMARY:AGM - NOT A RUN
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nPlease join us for the AGM at the HD An
 ywhere Stadium (Malvern Town FC) Langland Avenue\, Malvern WR14 2EQ\, when 
 you can vote for your committee members and be updated as to how the Malver
 n Buzzards Running Club is doing.\nAny questions will be answered and after
  the business of the meeting we have a presentation on nutrition which I am
  sure you will all find very useful.\nAfter that we can continue to sociali
 se while the bar stays open until 21:30.\nPlease click in if you shall be a
 ttending.\nIf you are unable to attend\, I shall be sending out information
  and proxy votes \nw/c 12th January.\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.
 com/clubs/208705/group_events/3444400174910285946\n\nSynced from Strava Clu
 b 208705 on Sun\, 11 Jan @ 5:49 PM
